{{search|Ghost Master in Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!|the [[Pokémon Coordinator]] from {{aniseries|RS}}|Chaz (anime)}}

'''Eiji''' (Japanese: '''エイジ''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Eiji can be found in the first of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Eiji will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Everybody's Friend Deck==
'''Everybody's Friend Deck''' (Japanese: '''みんなともだちデッキ''') is the deck played by Eiji. The deck features various types of Pokémon and takes advantage of cards like {{TCG ID|Base Set|Gust of Wind|93}} and {{TCG ID|Base Set|PlusPower|84}} to swap in desired opponents and quickly take them out.

